    "description": "API validation collection for the CIFAR-10 CNN Flask API from Task 4. TC01-TC06 are the core tests; TC07-TC11 are extended negative/validation tests. Place test_image.png, test_image_2.png and invalid.txt in the Postman working directory and re-select the files after import.",
